ibrary You don’t need to know these formats, but you’ll see that there are clearly differences that’ll cause probl
ems if you download your data in a format that your reference manager isn’t designed to understand. If you’re workin
g with sources that aren’t academic journals, you probably won’t have the luxury of these industry standard citation
